108
00:07:35.455 --> 00:07:38.416 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们做的对你有什么影响！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:38.499 --> 00:07:41.002 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生在救治付不起诊费的人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:41.085 --> 00:07:43.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是这点让我为难啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:44.547 --> 00:07:48.759 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>医疗本来就是价格昂贵的技术</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:48.843 --> 00:07:50.553 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>西医的价格</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:54.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>自从明治时期传来后一直水涨船高</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:54.891 --> 00:07:59.604 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果放任别人进行免费医疗</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:59.687 --> 00:08:03.858 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就会让西医贬价</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:04.692 --> 00:08:07.069 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别给她看病</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:11.199 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-否则…
-你就要对付我吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:11.282 --> 00:08:12.533 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别说蠢话</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:12.617 --> 00:08:16.871 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对居留地的外国人出手是最大的禁忌</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:16.954 --> 00:08:20.333 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要对付的是那个倒在路上的女人</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:20.416 --> 00:08:24.253 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果患者病入膏肓
你也没法再救治她了</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:25.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>妈妈！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:29.383 --> 00:08:30.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都别说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:31.385 --> 00:08:34.263 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在给这位夫人治病才最要紧</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:36.807 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你少插手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:36.891 --> 00:08:40.061 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则我用这个把你的眼睛挖出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:40.144 --> 00:08:42.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:45.608 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？你这不是违反废刀令吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:47.026 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也有资格说别人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:47.109 --> 00:08:50.613 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治时代的横滨
还准备摆武士架子吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:51.364 --> 00:08:52.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞起来了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:56.285 --> 00:08:58.829 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还敢乱动！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:04.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 我们等你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:04.252 --> 00:09:06.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>女孩和妈妈就交给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:07.338 --> 00:09:10.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你这家伙！
-埃尔德先生 快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:11.926 --> 00:09:14.595 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>戴着面具 来历不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:14.679 --> 00:09:16.097 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真的是医生吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.475 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-最好不要牵扯进去
-是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:22.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着保镖吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:23.396 --> 00:09:28.150 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 这样的话我有一计</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:30.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>查出他的住处</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:32.989 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我有口信给他
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在酒店又多订了一间房</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:46.836 --> 00:09:49.922 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在病情好转前 她最好安心静养</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:50.006 --> 00:09:52.883 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来药开始起效了</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:52.967 --> 00:09:55.845 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果烧退了 她就会好起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:55.928 --> 00:09:57.930 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>外国大夫 谢谢你</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:58.014 --> 00:10:00.016 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不客气</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:01.309 --> 00:10:03.477 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他医治这么尽心尽力啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:03.561 --> 00:10:06.230 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在我腿断了的时候 他也是一样用心</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:06.314 --> 00:10:08.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为知道我病着没法拉车赚钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:09.025 --> 00:10:11.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他无论如何都不肯接受诊费</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:11.652 --> 00:10:15.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅如此 在我好转后
他还雇佣我让我赚钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:18.868 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不收无力负担的人一分一毫</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:21.662 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽力帮助有需要的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:23.664 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他就是这种人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:23.748 --> 00:10:27.501 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-多谢你啊 男吉
-不…</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:27.585 --> 00:10:30.963 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才应该谢谢你啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:31.547 --> 00:10:33.382 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 要搭车吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:35.968 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“绝不收无力负担的人一分一毫</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:36.052 --> 00:10:37.803 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽力帮助有需要的人…”</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:37.887 --> 00:10:39.847 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不付车费的直接送到警局</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:42.141 --> 00:10:45.519 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客 走路就可以了</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:45.603 --> 00:10:48.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 这样更像你</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:51.817 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客先生也帮了大忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:54.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为回礼 要喝点茶吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:54.945 --> 00:10:57.156 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-下午茶
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:57.239 --> 00:10:59.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>男吉 也一起来吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:59.742 --> 00:11:03.245 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然 虽然不知道那是什么
但我很乐意一起！</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:04.997 --> 00:11:08.584 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天天气很好 就在户外喝茶吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:08.668 --> 00:11:09.919 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好主意</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:10.002 --> 00:11:12.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在户外喝茶吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:15.508 --> 00:11:16.425 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:18.469 --> 00:11:19.678 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:23.891 --> 00:11:25.559 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:26.227 --> 00:11:29.021 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这下我来日本值了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:31.857 --> 00:11:33.776 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>西洋剑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:41.242 --> 00:11:43.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好漂亮的花园</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:43.619 --> 00:11:47.123 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>瑞香花散发着清香 春天来了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请用吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:54.380 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么让我们为遇到浪客干杯！</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:54.463 --> 00:11:56.340 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用红茶干杯吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:56.424 --> 00:11:59.218 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要在意这种小事</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:01.679 --> 00:12:04.849 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是西洋茶和点心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:04.932 --> 00:12:07.101 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不客气了</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:12.273 --> 00:12:13.274 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好喝</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.987 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 你也别客气了 快吃吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:19.321 --> 00:12:20.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:30.374 --> 00:12:32.710 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>味道不错吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:34.003 --> 00:12:36.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>点心清甜好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.382 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>红茶味道如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:38.466 --> 00:12:41.260 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用的是很好的茶叶</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:41.343 --> 00:12:44.138 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢你请在下品茶</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:45.431 --> 00:12:49.643 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你无法品尝红茶的味道吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:51.312 --> 00:12:52.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>老实说 是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:52.938 --> 00:12:57.067 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 看来你有点累了</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:57.151 --> 00:13:00.279 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟他跟那群家伙折腾了半天</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:00.946 --> 00:13:04.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下并没有感到疲累啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:05.034 --> 00:13:07.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是只有身体会累的</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:09.288 --> 00:13:13.834 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>能闻到花香却品不到茶香</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:13.918 --> 00:13:16.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是你的心累了</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:17.296 --> 00:13:18.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:19.215 --> 00:13:22.927 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>外国的医生说的话真是有意思啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:24.178 --> 00:13:27.348 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你其实是很有名的武士吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:27.431 --> 00:13:29.558 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个嘛…</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:29.642 --> 00:13:32.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时期一定很活跃吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.898 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道了 你是那个！新选组吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.818 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:40.653 --> 00:13:45.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末的京都形势险恶
但横滨也是够呛啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:46.325 --> 00:13:50.412 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟突然就成了外国人居留地啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:50.996 --> 00:13:53.958 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨真的变成了一个有趣的城市</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:54.041 --> 00:13:57.920 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说起文明开化的程度
不输给东京和函馆</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:02.716 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨一定有很多外国来的稀罕物</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:06.387 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和新技术制造的产品吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:07.638 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:07.721 --> 00:14:11.058 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨真的是个好地方 我超喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:11.141 --> 00:14:16.313 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有好几个推荐的景点
要不要我用车拉着你转转？</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:16.397 --> 00:14:19.483 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧 在下身上没钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:19.567 --> 00:14:21.110 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 我忘了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:22.194 --> 00:14:24.280 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那这样如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:24.363 --> 00:14:26.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你拉着我</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:26.407 --> 00:14:29.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我坐在车上 给你介绍各个地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:29.451 --> 00:14:31.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你就不用付车费了</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:31.453 --> 00:14:33.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是个有趣的主意</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:37.334 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那埃尔德医生也一起来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:37.418 --> 00:14:39.086 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也一起？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:39.169 --> 00:14:41.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>车上只能坐一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:41.505 --> 00:14:43.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>三个人一起还多出一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:43.924 --> 00:14:46.051 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就石头剪子布决定</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:46.135 --> 00:14:48.470 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最先输的人负责拉车</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:52.600 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赢家坐车 剩下的那个就跟着车跑</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:52.683 --> 00:14:55.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是你输了怎么办 男吉？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别想那么多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:59.982 --> 00:15:01.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>石头剪子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:01.483 --> 00:15:03.277 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>石头剪子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.614 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:06.697 --> 00:15:07.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:07.948 --> 00:15:09.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.994 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:12.578 --> 00:15:14.705 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们这么有默契啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:14.788 --> 00:15:18.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个概率 简直是奇迹</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.127 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:23.589 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是这样没解决问题啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:23.672 --> 00:15:27.635 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就抽签吧
不管抽到什么都不准抱怨</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:34.850 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来拉车！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:36.810 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下坐车</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:36.894 --> 00:15:39.271 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 出发吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:48.447 --> 00:15:51.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨居留地39号</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:51.992 --> 00:15:53.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>致力于在日本普及医疗</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:53.869 --> 00:15:58.916 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及翻译《圣经》的美国传教士赫本</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:58.999 --> 00:16:01.877 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在此处建立了赫本学校</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:03.087 --> 00:16:05.047 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个时代的横滨港</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:09.551 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>水深不足以容纳大型船只靠岸</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:09.635 --> 00:16:14.723 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此使用名为“驳船”的小船
在码头间运送货物</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:20.187 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了防止海浪而建成的曲线形码头
被称为大象的鼻子</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:24.358 --> 00:16:25.985 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨站</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:16:26.652 --> 00:16:29.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治五年 在新桥和横滨之间</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:16:29.738 --> 00:16:34.702 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为文明开化的象征
开通了日本第一条铁路</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:35.411 --> 00:16:40.624 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该车站由美国建筑师布里奇斯设计</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:40.708 --> 00:16:44.253 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>广受好评 甚至被画在浮世绘上</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:52.803 --> 00:16:55.931 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在横滨观光的感想如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:56.015 --> 00:16:59.351 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下感觉到了新时代风貌
是很好的城市啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:59.435 --> 00:17:00.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:01.061 --> 00:17:02.521 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在你明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:02.604 --> 00:17:04.565 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在横滨住三天就算是横滨人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:04.648 --> 00:17:08.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再做浪客了 干脆做横滨人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:08.277 --> 00:17:09.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:11.655 --> 00:17:14.491 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我就先回去了 再见</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:18.662 --> 00:17:22.499 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-真的可以吗？
-没关系的</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:22.583 --> 00:17:25.419 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个时间也找不到住处了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:33.093 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-请
-多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:33.677 --> 00:17:37.306 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>进了室内也会脱鞋啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.101 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好像突然变矮了 埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:41.185 --> 00:17:45.773 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是你的错觉
外国人在室内看起来会更矮</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:45.856 --> 00:17:48.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有这种事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:48.317 --> 00:17:51.153 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-好奇怪啊
-我去换衣服了</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:51.236 --> 00:17:53.614 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>先去卧室了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:59.953 --> 00:18:03.373 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有一条给埃尔德医生的口信</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:03.457 --> 00:18:07.336 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-啊？
-给医生的口信</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:10.005 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是给埃尔德医生的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:10.089 --> 00:18:11.882 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是的 埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:16.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>应该把这个交给他…大概吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:17.221 --> 00:18:19.723 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生 有你的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.725 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:27.689 --> 00:18:29.399 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:29.483 --> 00:18:32.277 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>失礼了！在下不知道你是女孩子</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:32.361 --> 00:18:36.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是你的错觉
外国人有时候会改变性别</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:40.911 --> 00:18:43.455 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 骗你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:45.374 --> 00:18:47.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是有什么苦衷吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:54.341 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我解释给你听 请进吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:56.593 --> 00:18:57.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（波特酒）</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:57.511 --> 00:18:59.555 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:59.638 --> 00:19:03.475 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是个总是戴着面具遮住脸 身份不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:03.559 --> 00:19:07.229 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但医术一流的流浪医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:07.312 --> 00:19:12.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一边顺应富豪名流的请求环游世界</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:12.234 --> 00:19:15.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一边救治穷苦病人</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:15.904 --> 00:19:19.283 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你想处理掉那个埃尔德医生吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:19.366 --> 00:19:22.744 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是的 这是我的地盘</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:29.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有冷酷地干掉妨碍我的人
才能杀鸡儆猴</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:29.168 --> 00:19:35.007 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过日本人杀掉外国人
可没那么容易脱身</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:35.674 --> 00:19:38.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 所以你才叫我们来</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:38.468 --> 00:19:39.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:40.637 --> 00:19:45.934 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生身边有一个保镖
我的手下无人能敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:46.518 --> 00:19:50.772 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左脸颊有十字刀疤的臭武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:50.856 --> 00:19:51.857 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.692 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:53.775 --> 00:19:58.780 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们有一位十分渴望
与高手武士交手的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有工作了 艾斯佩拉尔</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:20:04.286 --> 00:20:07.998 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有十字刀疤的武士 是那时候的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:09.041 --> 00:20:10.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:14.796 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>盛名远传</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.926 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>海外的精通武士刀的大师</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:19.009 --> 00:20:20.636 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:20.719 --> 00:20:23.347 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩杀不敬之敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:30.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了荣誉甚至愿意切腹自尽的
自尊心极高的狂战士</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:30.479 --> 00:20:36.026 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们在十年前明治维新后
就销声匿迹了</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:36.109 --> 00:20:43.033 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过抱着一线希望
我还是千里迢迢来到了这个岛国…</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:43.116 --> 00:20:45.994 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只求跟武士一战</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:46.078 --> 00:20:48.622 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个有十字刀疤的武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:48.705 --> 00:20:52.542 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来是幕末时期京都的有名剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:54.044 --> 00:20:56.255 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时代的幸存者啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:56.338 --> 00:20:58.507 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪不得他这么厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:59.424 --> 00:21:02.177 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是你梦寐以求的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:21:03.929 --> 00:21:06.056 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有十字刀疤的武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:21:07.474 --> 00:21:10.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中最强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

